{"task_id": "af63a40e2cdfa253", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting up elimination\n\nWrite the system as rows:\n\n1. $-23x_1 -21x_2 +19x_3 +4x_4 +26x_5 +24x_6 = -50$\n2. $23x_1 -4x_2 -15x_3 +3x_4 +25x_5 +5x_6 = 52$\n3. $-24x_1 -14x_2 +17x_3 +2x_4 -15x_5 -15x_6 = -50$\n4. $12x_1 -22x_2 -25x_3 +11x_4 -3x_5 -5x_6 = 89$\n5. $26x_1 -25x_2 -7x_3 -23x_4 -19x_5 -29x_6 = -277$\n6. $22x_1 -28x_2 -28x_3 +15x_4 -22x_5 -26x_6 = 21$\n\n**Pivot $x_1$.** Using integer combinations (to stay in $\\mathbb Z$):\n- $(1)+(2)$: $-25x_2+4x_3+7x_4+51x_5+29x_6=2$ — (A)\n- $24(1)-23(3)$: $-182x_2+65x_3+50x_4+969x_5+921x_6=-50$ — (B)\n- $12(1)+23(4)$: $-758x_2-347x_3+301x_4+243x_5+173x_6=1447$ — (C)\n- $26(1)+23(5)$: $-1121x_2+333x_3-425x_4+239x_5-43x_6=-7671$ — (D)\n- $22(1)+23(6)$: $-1106x_2-226x_3+433x_4+66x_5-70x_6=-617$ — (E)\n\n**Pivot $x_2$** with (A): replacing (B),(C),(D),(E) by $25\\cdot(\\cdot)-k\\cdot$ (A):\n- $897x_3-24x_4+14943x_5+17747x_6=-1614$ — (B′)\n- $-11707x_3+2219x_4-32583x_5-17657x_6=34659$ — (C′)\n- $3841x_3-18472x_4-51196x_5-33584x_6=-194017$ — (D′)\n- $-10074x_3+3083x_4-54756x_5-33824x_6=-17637$ — (E′)\n\n**Pivot $x_3$** with (B′), reducing by common factors ($25\\cdot23$, $25\\cdot23$, $75\\cdot23$):\n- $2973x_4+253410x_5+333784x_6=21207$ — [1]\n- $659088x_4+4132755x_5+3931643x_6=6713355$ — [2]\n- $33649x_4+1352262x_5+1979242x_6=-427731$ — [3]\n\n**Pivot $x_4$** ($[3]\\cdot2973-[1]\\cdot33649$, $[2]\\cdot2973-[1]\\cdot659088$), reducing by $2\\cdot3\\cdot6877$ and $3\\cdot6877$:\n- $327666x_5+388775x_6=144339$ — [4]\n- $7500015x_5+10096663x_6=-289929$ — [5]\n\n**Solve the $2\\times2$:** $\\Delta = 327666\\cdot10096663-388775\\cdot7500015 = 392{,}514{,}846{,}933$.\n\n- $x_5=\\dfrac{144339\\cdot10096663+388775\\cdot289929}{\\Delta}=\\dfrac{1{,}570{,}059{,}387{,}732}{392{,}514{,}846{,}933}=4$\n- $x_6=\\dfrac{-327666\\cdot289929-7500015\\cdot144339}{\\Delta}=\\dfrac{-1{,}177{,}544{,}540{,}799}{392{,}514{,}846{,}933}=-3$\n\n## Back-substitution\n\n- From [1]: $2973x_4 = 21207-253410(4)-333784(-3)=8919 \\Rightarrow x_4=3$\n- From (B′): $897x_3 = -1614+24(3)-14943(4)+17747(3)=-8073 \\Rightarrow x_3=-9$\n- From (A): $-25x_2 = 2-4(-9)-7(3)-51(4)-29(-3)=-100 \\Rightarrow x_2=4$\n- From (1): $-23x_1 = -50+21(4)-19(-9)-4(3)-26(4)-24(-3)=161 \\Rightarrow x_1=-7$\n\n## Verification\n\n- (1): $161-84-171+12+104-72=-50$ ✓\n- (2): $-161-16+135+9+100-15=52$ ✓\n- (3): $168-56-153+6-60+45=-50$ ✓\n- (4): $-84-88+225+33-12+15=89$ ✓\n- (5): $-182-100+63-69-76+87=-277$ ✓\n- (6): $-154-112+252+45-88+78=21$ ✓\n\nAll six equations hold exactly.\n\n{\"answer\": [-7, 4, -9, 3, 4, -3]}", "parsed_answer": "[-7, 4, -9, 3, 4, -3]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 531879, "usage": {"input": 477, "output": 25080, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 23283, "totalTokens": 25557, "cost": {"input": 6.678000000000001e-05, "output": 0.007022400000000001, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0070891800000000005}}, "cost_usd": 0.0070891800000000005, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "high", "responseId": "80f77c38-5c53-44dc-9a53-c2ff36393895_49b6bc96791a433285af6acff6671701"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-30T09:13:18+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-30T09:22:10+00:00"}
{"task_id": "b331470aece46ee7", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting up\n\nThe sixth equation has a coefficient of $-1$ for $x_2$, so I use it to eliminate $x_2$.\n\nFrom (6): $-20x_1 - x_2 - 27x_3 + 2x_4 - 6x_5 + 15x_6 = -372$, so\n\n$$x_2 = 372 - 20x_1 - 27x_3 + 2x_4 - 6x_5 + 15x_6 .$$\n\nSubstituting into (1)–(5) (using $a_{i2}\\cdot f$ with $f$ the right side) gives, after dividing (1) by 2:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n(1')&\\quad 252x_1 + 362x_3 - 38x_4 + 63x_5 - 194x_6 = 4829\\\\\n(2')&\\quad -214x_1 - 271x_3 + 21x_4 - 87x_5 + 141x_6 = -3745\\\\\n(3')&\\quad 88x_1 + 121x_3 + 11x_4 + 23x_5 - 51x_6 = 1497\\\\\n(4')&\\quad -424x_1 - 520x_3 + 55x_4 - 147x_5 + 293x_6 = -7317\\\\\n(5')&\\quad 374x_1 + 497x_3 - 17x_4 + 116x_5 - 307x_6 = 6948\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n## Eliminating $x_1$\n\n$(4') - 2(2'):\\; 4x_1 + 22x_3 + 13x_4 + 27x_5 + 11x_6 = 173$ (call $F$).\n\nThen: $(1')-63F$, $2(2')+107F$, $(3')-22F$, $2(5')-187F$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1024x_3 -857x_4 -1638x_5 -887x_6 &= -6070\\\\\n1812x_3 + 1433x_4 + 2715x_5 + 1459x_6 &= 11021\\\\\n-363x_3 -275x_4 -571x_5 -293x_6 &= -2309\\\\\n-3120x_3 -2465x_4 -4817x_5 -2671x_6 &= -18455\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRow4 − 3·Row1 gives the small relation $-48x_3 + 106x_4 + 97x_5 - 10x_6 = -245$ (call $H$).\n\n## Eliminating $x_3$\n\n$3\\cdot$Row1 $-64H$, $4\\cdot$Row2 $+151H$, $16\\cdot$Row3 $-121H$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n9355x_4 + 11122x_5 + 2021x_6 &= 2530\\\\\n21738x_4 + 25507x_5 + 4326x_6 &= 7089\\\\\n17226x_4 + 20873x_5 + 3478x_6 &= 7299\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferences: $K_1 = J_2-2J_1:\\;3028x_4+3263x_5+284x_6=2029$; $K_2=J_3-J_1:\\;7871x_4+9751x_5+1457x_6=4769$; $K_3=(J_3-J_2)/2:\\;2256x_4+2317x_5+424x_6=-105$.\n\n$L=K_1-K_3$ (÷2): $386x_4+473x_5-70x_6=1067$; $M_1=K_2-20L:\\;151x_4+291x_5+2857x_6=-16571$; $M_2=(K_1-7L)/2:\\;163x_4-24x_5+387x_6=-2720$.\n\nEliminating $x_4$:\n$$51057x_5 + 407254x_6 = -2290353,\\qquad 933683x_5 - 1604293x_6 = 12426807 .$$\n\nThe determinant is $-462{,}156{,}524{,}183$, and the numerator for $x_5$ is $-1{,}386{,}469{,}572{,}549 = 3\\cdot(-462{,}156{,}524{,}183)$, so $x_5=3$. Then $407254x_6 = -2443524 \\Rightarrow x_6=-6$.\n\n## Back substitution\n\n- $M_2:\\ 163x_4 - 72 - 2322 = -2720 \\Rightarrow 163x_4 = -326 \\Rightarrow x_4 = -2$\n- $H:\\ -48x_3 - 212 + 291 + 60 = -245 \\Rightarrow -48x_3 = -384 \\Rightarrow x_3 = 8$\n- $F:\\ 4x_1 + 176 - 26 + 81 - 66 = 173 \\Rightarrow 4x_1 = 8 \\Rightarrow x_1 = 2$\n- $x_2 = 372 - 40 - 216 - 4 - 18 - 90 = 4$\n\n## Verification\n\n- (1) $-32-104+176+48-90-12 = -14$ ✓\n- (2) $12+44+208+2-63+144 = 347$ ✓\n- (3) $-24-20-112-42-21-144 = -363$ ✓\n- (4) $-48+80+160-30-81+42 = 123$ ✓\n- (5) $-12-76-128-42+6+132 = -120$ ✓\n- (6) $-40-4-216-4-18-90 = -372$ ✓\n\n{\"answer\": [2, 4, 8, -2, 3, -6]}", "parsed_answer": "[2, 4, 8, -2, 3, -6]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 1020776, "usage": {"input": 477, "output": 47854, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 46053, "totalTokens": 48331, "cost": {"input": 6.678000000000001e-05, "output": 0.01339912, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.013465900000000001}}, "cost_usd": 0.013465900000000001, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "high", "responseId": "c71a5a36-a6e6-4bc3-baf1-0c34f50dfe95_e22103da51544022aa1200ca7bd69bdb"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-30T09:18:04+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-30T09:35:05+00:00"}
{"task_id": "f6ef5a90f7c156e4", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "# Solving the System Exactly\n\n## Setup\n\nThe system is $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ with\n\n$$A=\\begin{pmatrix}-23&-8&-2&14&-22&-23\\\\17&-8&-4&-25&18&-21\\\\3&-10&27&17&24&-... \\end{pmatrix}$$\n\nSince I must be exact, I combine two things: reduction modulo small primes (to pin down a candidate) and a full substitution check (which certifies the answer).\n\n**Elimination mod 3:** gives $x\\equiv(2,2,2,1,0,2)$.\n**Mod 2:** gives $x\\equiv(1,0,1,0,1,0)$ (odd/even pattern).\n**Mod 5:** the equations reduce to $x_6\\equiv 1$, $x_1+x_4\\equiv 3$, $x_1+2x_4\\equiv 1$, hence $x\\equiv(0,3,0,3,2,1)$.\n**Mod 7:** one free parameter, $x\\equiv(6+2t,\\,3+4t,\\,6+2t,\\,2t-1,\\,4,\\,t)$.\n**Mod 11 (Gaussian elimination):** $x\\equiv(5,8,5,9,8,7)$ — verified in all six rows.\n**Mod 13 (Gaussian elimination):** $x\\equiv(5,8,5,11,10,9)$ — verified in all six rows.\n\nSince $11\\cdot 13 = 143$ and the small residues agree, the candidate is\n$$x_1=5,\\; x_2=8,\\; x_3=5,\\; x_4=-2,\\; x_5=-3,\\; x_6=-4,$$\nwhich simultaneously satisfies the mod 2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13 data (e.g. $-2\\equiv 5 \\pmod 7$, $-2\\equiv 9\\pmod{11}$, $-2\\equiv 11\\pmod{13}$, etc.).\n\n## Verification in the original equations\n\n- Row 1: $-115-64-10-28+66+92=-59$ ✓\n- Row 2: $85-64-20+50-54+84=81$ ✓\n- Row 3: $15-80+135-34-72-36=-72$ ✓\n- Row 4: $-130-72-55-20+45-108=-340$ ✓\n- Row 5: $145+80+125-38+24-96=240$ ✓\n- Row 6: $-55+24-10+28+30+112=129$ ✓\n\nAll six equations hold exactly, and the system is nonsingular (the residues are uniquely determined modulo 11 and 13), so the solution is unique.\n\n$$\\mathbf{x} = (5,\\,8,\\,5,\\,-2,\\,-3,\\,-4)$$\n\n{\"answer\": [5, 8, 5, -2, -3, -4]}", "parsed_answer": "[5, 8, 5, -2, -3, -4]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 1060166, "usage": {"input": 30, "output": 48410, "cacheRead": 448, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 47620, "totalTokens": 48888, "cost": {"input": 4.2000000000000004e-06, "output": 0.0135548, "cacheRead": 1.2544e-06, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0135602544}}, "cost_usd": 0.0135602544, "attempts": 2, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "high", "responseId": "2e294d3a-6cf0-4eb1-add3-7140570c3e17_61b398ab48ea4b88a2c807ca6f2e39ca"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-30T09:01:50+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-30T09:39:31+00:00"}
{"task_id": "78c4fa0e7706d486", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "# Solving the 6×6 Linear System\n\n## Setting up\n\nI'll solve mod 101 first (a prime where elimination is clean), then verify the candidate exactly.\n\n**Mod 101, the RHS values reduce to:** 32, 15, 58, 97(≡−4), 7, 94(≡−7).\n\n## Elimination mod 101\n\n**Eliminating x₁** (using 28·Rᵢ ± aᵢ₁·R₁):\n\n- R₂′: 49x₂ + 61x₃ + 58x₄ + 5x₅ + 57x₆ = 97\n- R₃′: 64x₂ + 79x₃ + 10x₄ + 64x₆ = 80\n- R₄′: 64x₂ + 63x₃ + 71x₄ + 6x₅ + 16x₆ = 8\n- R₅′: 39x₂ + 49x₃ + 50x₅ + 14x₆ = 38\n- R₆′: 48x₂ + 17x₃ + 55x₄ + 6x₅ + 36x₆ = 62\n\n(I cross-checked each of these against the corresponding integer-reduced rows, e.g. −13x₂ + 91x₃ − 137x₄ − 24x₅ − 112x₆ = −203, reduced mod 101 — all matched.)\n\n**Eliminating x₂** (pivot 49): R₃″: 68x₃ + 10x₄ + 84x₅ + 94x₆ = 35; R₄″: 92x₃ + 70x₄ + 75x₅ + 65x₆ = 42; R₅″: 22x₃ + 61x₄ + 33x₅ + 79x₆ = 99; R₆″: 26x₃ + 12x₄ + 54x₅ + 38x₆ = 99.\n\n**Eliminating x₃** (pivot 68, 68⁻¹ ≡ 52): R₄‴: 2x₄ + 99x₅ + 14x₆ = 40; R₅‴: 90x₄ + 93x₅ + 72x₆ = 3; R₆‴: 51x₄ + 74x₅ + 39x₆ = 65.\n\n**Eliminating x₄**: R₅‴′: 63x₅ + 96x₆ = 42; R₆‴′: 48x₅ + 71x₆ = 9.\n\n**Eliminating x₅**: 67x₆ ≡ 66 → x₆ ≡ 66·98 ≡ **4** (mod 101).\n\nBack-substituting: 63x₅ = 42 − 384 ≡ 62 → x₅ ≡ 62·93 ≡ **9**; 2x₄ = 40 − 891 − 56 ≡ 2 → x₄ ≡ **1**; 68x₃ = 35 − 10 − 756 − 376 ≡ 4 → x₃ ≡ 4·52 ≡ **6**; 49x₂ ≡ 6 → x₂ ≡ 6·33 ≡ 97 ≡ **−4**; 28x₁ ≡ 51 → x₁ ≡ 51·83 ≡ 92 ≡ **−9**.\n\nThis strongly suggests the integral solution **(−9, −4, 6, 1, 9, 4)**.\n\n## Exact verification in the original system\n\nWith x = (−9, −4, 6, 1, 9, 4):\n\n1. 28(−9) − 2(−4) − 21(6) + 22(1) − 22(9) − 7(4) = −252 + 8 − 126 + 22 − 198 − 28 = **−574** ✓\n2. −12(−9) − (−4) + 22(6) − 29(1) + 6(9) − 13(4) = 108 + 4 + 132 − 29 + 54 − 52 = **217** ✓\n3. 23(−9) − 21(−4) + 4(1) + 18(9) + 29(4) = −207 + 84 + 4 + 162 + 116 = **159** ✓\n4. −29(−9) + 26(−4) + 24(6) + 5(1) + 23(9) − 3(4) = 261 − 104 + 144 + 5 + 207 − 12 = **501** ✓\n5. −14(−9) + 6(−4) − 13(6) − 11(1) + 20(9) + 4(4) = 126 − 24 − 78 − 11 + 180 + 16 = **209** ✓\n6. −27(−9) − 18(−4) − 8(6) + 6(1) + 7(9) − 10(4) = 243 + 72 − 48 + 6 + 63 − 40 = **296** ✓\n\nAll six equations hold exactly, and the system has a unique solution.\n\n{\"answer\": [-9, -4, 6, 1, 9, 4]}", "parsed_answer": "[-9, -4, 6, 1, 9, 4]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 1044944, "usage": {"input": 472, "output": 46257, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 44779, "totalTokens": 46729, "cost": {"input": 6.608e-05, "output": 0.01295196, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.01301804}}, "cost_usd": 0.01301804, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "high", "responseId": "e5dc105d-0c36-4187-baf8-cfe3a7aa6b59_273b6b061a944c2da84c9e3975b19477"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-30T09:22:10+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-30T09:39:35+00:00"}
{"task_id": "4d9f8aff87e282da", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting up\n\nThe system has 8 equations in 8 unknowns with a guaranteed unique solution. I eliminated the unknowns (using scaled Gaussian elimination, working modulo primes to keep intermediate numbers small), obtaining residues for each variable. Whenever residues modulo different primes disagree on magnitude, the only reliable arbiter is **direct substitution** — a candidate vector either satisfies all eight equations exactly or it does not.\n\n## Candidate found\n\nModulo 103 the elimination gave:\n\n$$x \\equiv (6,\\,-4,\\,4,\\,-2,\\,1,\\,6,\\,-3,\\,5) \\pmod{103}$$\n\nSince all entries lie in a small range, I tested this vector directly over $\\mathbb{Z}$ in the original system.\n\n## Verification (exact, integer arithmetic)\n\n**Eq 1:** $-7(6)-22(-4)-9(4)+2(-2)+8(1)+18(6)+13(-3)+15(5) = -42+88-36-4+8+108-39+75 = 158$ ✓\n\n**Eq 2:** $-20(6)+20(-4)-30(4)-21(-2)-12(1)-3(6)+28(-3)-27(5) = -120-80-120+42-12-18-84-135 = -527$ ✓\n\n**Eq 3:** $-24(-4)+18(4)-(-2)-18(1)+21(6)+28(-3)-25(5) = 96+72+2-18+126-84-125 = 69$ ✓\n\n**Eq 4:** $-12(6)+23(-4)+2(4)+28(-2)+1+6-27(-3)+14(5) = -72-92+8-56+1+6+81+70 = -54$ ✓\n\n**Eq 5:** $-25(6)-24(-4)-26(4)+5(-2)+6+22(6)+12(-3)-10(5) = -150+96-104-10+6+132-36-50 = -116$ ✓\n\n**Eq 6:** $11(6)-6(-4)+8(4)-30(-2)+15+5(6)-6(-3)+21(5) = 66+24+32+60+15+30+18+105 = 350$ ✓\n\n**Eq 7:** $15(6)-15(-4)-4(4)-4(-2)+28-12(6)+28(-3)-13(5) = 90+60-16+8+28-72-84-65 = -51$ ✓\n\n**Eq 8:** $-30(6)-13(-4)+17(4)+6(-2)+26-7(6)-17(-3)+30(5) = -180+52+68-12+26-42+51+150 = 113$ ✓\n\nEvery equation holds **exactly** over the integers, so by uniqueness this is the solution.\n\n{\"answer\": [6, -4, 4, -2, 1, 6, -3, 5]}", "parsed_answer": "[6, -4, 4, -2, 1, 6, -3, 5]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 489777, "usage": {"input": 636, "output": 39033, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 38219, "totalTokens": 39669, "cost": {"inp